--- Rosetta Code: Averages/Root mean square
--- https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Averages/Root_mean_square
--- A list of numbers is a tensor to the operators: square it item by item with
--- .*, take the mean, then the square root.
use math

fn rms[xs]
    return sqrt[mean[xs .* xs]]

log[rms[range[1, 11]]]
